00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,000
Bi çetinî ye.
 
It is with difficulty.

168
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:19,000
Are wela.
 
Yes really.

169
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,000
Ji kunkê xera sê çar rojan tiştna yekî berdanê.
 
From [indistinct] three four days someone drops things off.

170
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,000
Îşta em hatin, xizmet kin wekê berê...
 
Now we came, to serve like before...

171
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:25,000
Çîkî dor çê bibin...
 
So some things would be fixed...

172
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:27,000
Ê çêbin, Cokê rehmet jî bibare, ê çêbibin inşallah.
 
They will be fixed, may Mercy (God) rain down too, they will
be fixed God willing.

173
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:31,000
Boraneg lêkemrî Xwedê.
 
A storm by the command of God.

174
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,000
Are.
 
Yes.

175
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:34,000
Kereba, Xalo, kereba yî ne gihîştiye wa?
 
Electricity, Uncle, has electricity not reached you?

176
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,000
Na.
 
No.

177
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,000
Hîç?
 
Not at all?

178
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:38,000
Hîç tişkî. Çûl û çol e wekê vana, taqê hewandin.
 
Nothing at all. It is wilderness and desert like this, they
put up [solar] panels.

179
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:40,000
Lûhê taqê şemsî ye hewandin.
 
They have installed solar panels.

180
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:43,000
Are, gund da giya lûh e.
 
Yes, in the village it's all panels.

181
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:48,000
İnşallah, inşallah, lûhê jî, û niha kareba jî ê were
inşallah, bi îzna Xwedê.
 
God willing, God willing, the panels too, and now the
electricity will come too God willing, with God's
permission.

182
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:50,000
Wela cemaet, kareba heye ba'dê nîvro?
 
Well folks, is there electricity in the afternoon?

183
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,000
Ê... tê, tê...
 
Uh... it comes, it comes...

184
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:53,000
Hikmet.
 
Hikmet.

185
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:55,000
Mobata, gi da ro.
 
Mobiles, [indistinct].

186
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:59,000
Bes gundê biçûk, tiştekî heye derenge pêkîniye, lûhê şemsî
ne.
 
But the small village, there is something [indistinct] has
brought, it is solar panels.

187
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,000
Xalo, hewş e kî ye?
 
Uncle, whose courtyard is this?

188
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:00,000
Hêdî waredî, rind bigre daxîna.
 
It is Ali's courtyard.

189
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:03,000
Hêdî waredî, rind bigre daxîna.
 
Slowly come down, capture the descent well.

190
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:09,000
Xalo, gundî we pir xirabî ye, wa hewşê xo kavil kirine jî
ha.
 
Uncle, your village is very ruined, they have let their
courtyards fall into ruin too, ha.

191
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:11,000
Wela, vana kavil bûn xirabî.
 
Well, these became ruins, destruction.

192
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,000
Pir xirabî.
 
Lots of destruction.

193
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,000
Avo?
 
This one?

194
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,000
Erê.
 
Yes.

195
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:15,000
Eywa.
 
Yeah.

196
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,000
Hevo dused salime.
 
This one is two hundred years old.

197
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:20,000
Diqurijî ha, Xalo xê xaniyê diqurijî pir dehedimin, xêr e?
 
It is cracking ha, Uncle, the mud houses are cracking,
collapsing a lot, is it good?

198
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,000
Yex, dîwar, dî... lê dîwarkî...
 
No, wall, w... but a wall...

199
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:22,000
Sîmenta jêra bişiya.
 
Yeah.

200
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,000
Sîmenta jêra bişiya.
 
The cement washed away from under it.

201
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:25,000
Diqo erd hazî cema jî...
 
He was saying the ground is shaky too...

202
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,000
Erd quriqî...
 
The ground cracked...

203
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,000
Erê, evna gellek...
 
Yes, these are many...

204
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,000
Ê pir boqê ne.
 
They are very old.

205
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,000
Evna şîmentone.
 
These are concrete.

206
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:31,000
Saet xweş, Xwedê qûwetê bide we.
 
Have a good time, may God give you strength.

207
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:33,000
Qûwet bê, qûwet bê.
 
Strength be, strength be.

208
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:36,000
Îşta hesebê xo...
 
Now his account...

209
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,000
Yek didê yekî.
 
One gives to another.

210
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,000
Difirine.
 
They fly.

211
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:40,000
Gû... ox, havû...
 
Sh... oh, this one...

212
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:42,000
Are rigo ox, mognî kêber kêber, ox tê de.
 
Yes the road is oh, [indistinct], there is "oh" in it.

213
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,000
Hîç îmana tu tişkî ma tune.
 
There is absolutely no faith in anything left.

214
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:45,000
Tu kunkê çîman to nadî.
 
You don't give any [indistinct].

215
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:49,000
Lê, ê qoreke nehedmîne.
 
But, the sturdy one won't collapse.

216
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:51,000
Evna mala...
 
This house...

217
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:51,000
Are are.
 
Is Pirmî's.

218
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:56,000
Are are.
 
Yes yes.

219
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:58,000
Brîndarim...
 
I am wounded...

220
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:00,000
Xalo avyene şebeke ye wey ser û binî dane ne?
 
Uncle, is this a network (rebar) they put up and down?

221
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:02,000
No.
 
No.

222
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,000
Avo jûr e?
 
Is this a room?

223
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:05,000
Havo penç şeş mal e ne.
 
This is five or six households.

224
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:14,000
Eywa.
 
Yeah.

225
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:17,000
Are hevalno, îşta... avo gundê Rûta.
 
Yes friends, now... this is the village of Rûta.

226
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,000
Rûta ye.
 
It is Rûta.

227
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:20,000
Xalo wara wagû me'nê xo çiye.
 
Uncle come say what its meaning is.

228
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,000
Xê nav lê kirin?
 
Who named it?

229
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:26,000
Xalo gundê wa bi çi meşhûr e? Tiştê tê da no meşhûr de?
 
Uncle, what is your village famous for? Is there nothing
famous in it?

230
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,000
Bi ziraetê zeytûna.
 
With olive agriculture.

231
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:31,000
Gundê me kirmancokê wa ne.
 
Our village is of your Kurds.

232
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:34,000
Ê pirs dikin, çavê wan maç dikim.
 
Those who ask, I kiss their eyes.

233
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:37,000
Ê pirs nakin jî, ser seran û ser çavan.
 
Even those who don't ask, upon heads and upon eyes
(welcome).

234
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:43,000
Ser seran û ser çavan.
 
Upon heads and upon eyes.

235
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,000
Hevo bî bî ya ve Xalo?
 
Is this a well, this one Uncle?

236
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,000
Are.
 
Yes.

237
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:47,000
Bîr jûr e.
 
The upper well.

238
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:49,000
Bîra jûr e.
 
The upper well.

239
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:51,000
Havo yîn...
 
This is one...

240
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,000
Yê hewşê ne.
 
It's of the courtyard.

241
00:08:52,000 --> 00:09:07,000
Ê hewşê ne.
 
It's of the courtyard.

242
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,000
Merheba Xalo.
 
Hello Uncle.

243
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:08,000
Xwedê ji te razî be.
 
Welcome, upon eyes, upon eyes.

244
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:10,000
Xwedê ji te razî be.
 
May God be pleased with you.

245
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:15,000
Wele Xwedê ji te razî be.
 
Really may God be pleased with you.

246
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:17,000
Jwara...
 
Jwar...

247
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:22,000
Maşallah gundekî xweş e, cografî ya xo xweş e, mentîqê xo,
bes ne mezin e.
 
Mashallah it's a nice village, its geography is nice, its
area, but it's not big.

248
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,000
Ne mezin e.
 
It's not big.

249
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,000
Ne mezin e, biçûk e.
 
It's not big, it's small.

250
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,000
Ekserî mala jî xerabe ne.
 
The majority of houses are ruins too.

251
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:32,000
Are.
 
Yes.

252
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:35,000
De yyo şoşêkê wer e ser afdîş inşallah destê Xwedê.
 
[Indistinct] God willing [in] God's hand.

253
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,000
Birîndarim...
 
I am wounded...

254
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,000
Bê derman im...
 
I am without a cure...

255
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:39,000
Birîna min kûr e, kûr e...
 
My wound is deep, deep...

256
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:42,000
Bê hal im, dilêmîn...
 
I am helpless, my heart...

257
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:45,000
Mal û milkê xwo...
 
My home and property...

258
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:47,000
Em jî bîr nakin...
 
We also do not forget...

259
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:50,000
Koç û kurbûn xwo...
 
My migration and exile...

260
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:53,000
Ê bû candan e...
 
It became life-giving...

261
00:09:53,000 --> 00:10:09,000
Jî bû azadî...
 
It was for freedom...

262
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:15,000
Birê Hebîb, wela gundî wa... ew bî ye, perq xarabe ye.
 
Brother Habib, by God, this village of theirs... it is like
this, it is very ruined.

263
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:35,000
Em ji bîr nakin.
 
We do not forget.

264
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:37,000
Cenûb Efrîqya?
 
South Africa?

265
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:46,000
Rûto Rûto, lo xarabe ye, perq xarabe ye. War, war, em derbas
bin. Xalû Xaltîkê jî derxin.
 
Rûto Rûto, oh it is ruined, it is very ruined. Come, come,
let's pass. Bring Uncle and Aunty out too.

266
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:56,000
War jor, war jor.
 
Come up, come up.

267
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:59,000
Erê Hebîb, birêkî min, ava hewşa we ye?
 
Yes Habib, my brother, is this your yard?

268
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:00,000
Erê.
 
Yes.

269
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:05,000
Ava hewşa we ye. Ezê... ezê ji berta vê hewşê te germ ha?
 
This is your yard. I will... I will [film] you for the sake
of this yard, okay?

270
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:11,000
Maşallah.
 
Mashallah.

271
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:26,000
Erê... Tebîetê gundê Rinda, xuyaye mişkîla kes pir têda tune
ye, wana navê gundîk... milet tune ye milet. Hewş pir
xirabûyîne.
 
Yes... The nature of Rinda village, it seems there aren't
many problems for anyone here, they call it a village... but
there are no people, no people. The yards are very ruined.

272
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:32,000
Erê birê Hebîb, li vî derê em ortê hewşê waye, em... malbeta
waye... cem Xalû, Xalê Mihemed.
 
Yes brother Habib, here we are in the middle of their yard,
we are... their family... with Uncle, Uncle Mihemed.

273
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:35,000
Xalû, tiyê gotinekê bikî?
 
Uncle, will you say a word?

274
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:44,000
Silavê me li pirsa ra hene. Wana jî hatin pir kêfxweş bûn. Û
saeta we geş, Xwedê quwetê bide we, Xwedê me ji vê tengiyê
derîne.
 
Our greetings to those who asked. They also came and were
very happy. And may your hour be bright, may God give you
strength, may God take us out of this difficulty.

275
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:46,000
Amîn. Xalû gotinên te hene?
 
Amen. Uncle, do you have any words?

276
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:59,000
Saeta we xweş, Xwedê ji we razî be, silavê min ji giya ra
hene, xaseten ji xwişka min ra hene. Jêra tîr giya rojê de
Ewrûpa rojê de... Libnanê yê re silavê min ji giya ra hene.
Îgul Huseyn min re silavê min ji giya ra hene.
 
May your hour be happy, may God be pleased with you, my
greetings to everyone, especially to my sister. To her and
all in the West, in Europe... in Lebanon, my greetings to
everyone. Igul Huseyn, my greetings to everyone.

277
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:01,000
Saet xweş, Xwedê emirê te dirêj bike Xalo.
 
Happy hour, may God prolong your life, Uncle.

278
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:07,000
Wekî te dît me emîndî bûn, em pir kêfxweş bûn. Saeta we
xweş, Xwedê emirê te dirêj bike.
 
As you saw, we were safe, we were very happy. May your hour
be happy, may God prolong your life.

279
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:10,000
Bay bay bike, vî ra bay bay bike.
 
Wave bye-bye, wave bye-bye to this.

280
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:14,000
Hecî Îgul, Medîne, silav ji gîşkaro hene...
 
Hecî Îgul, Medîne, greetings to everyone...

281
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:20,000
Dêka bimînin xêrê, bimînin xêrê.
 
Okay, stay in goodness, stay in goodness.

282
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:25,000
Erê hevalno, li vî derê jî em hatin gundê Delo.
 
Yes friends, here we also came to the village of Delo.

283
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:31,000
Bira, teb'en Rûto gundekî çûçik bû, me nikarî pir têda
teswîr kira, ge xarabe bî.
 
Brother, of course Rûto was a small village, we couldn't
film much in it, it was very ruined.

284
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:37,000
Me go em gundê Delo jî, gundekî çûçik e, em ser va teswîr
kin.
 
We said let's film Delo village too, it's a small village,
let's film it along with that.

285
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:40,000
Kesê gundê Delo ne dîye, ava gundê Delo ye.
 
Anyone who hasn't seen Delo village, this is Delo village.

286
00:13:40,000 --> 00:14:00,000
Ka bimînin... em derbas nava gund bin.
 
Let's stay... let's pass into the village.

287
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:17,000
Gund ne pir xarabe ye, lê dilê meriv pê dişewite. Wela Rûto
dilê me pê şewitî.
 
The village isn't very ruined, but one's heart burns for it.
By God, our hearts burned for Rûto.

288
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:22,000
Me nikarî pir teswîr kira, lew bîntêda ye.
 
We couldn't film much, that's why it is short.

289
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:28,000
Em jî dixwazin milet kêfxweş kiren bidin, dilê milet şa
kiren bidin...
 
We also want to make the people happy, to gladden the
people's hearts...

290
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:40,000
Qora me'nî neqehirin.
 
Don't be upset with us.

291
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:55,000
Wela gundê Delo jî gundekî kevnar e.
 
By God, Delo village is also an ancient village.

292
00:14:55,000 --> 00:15:00,000
Teqe xanîd... xanîd kûrî... xanîd kûrî ge zilzalê xêr
kirina.
 
Look at the houses... the stone houses... the stone houses
that the earthquake ruined.

293
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:08,000
Yê kûrîkî pir na dê mînin... Bes yê kûrî ne mabênî ax
têdaye.
 
The stone ones don't remain much... But the stone ones have
earth between them.

294
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:27,000
Mabênî ax têdaye, wela pir hewşê kevnar têdaye ne.
 
There is earth between them, by God there are many ancient
yards in it.

295
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:29,000
Selam Eleykum.
 
Peace be upon you.

296
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:35,000
Selam, ehlen wa sehlen.
 
Peace, welcome.

297
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:48,000
Erê hevalno, vê gunda... miş... qolû pirskir... vê... ave,
çûçik e... dibê teqrîben sî, sîûpênc mal e. Ne mezin e.
 
Yes friends, this village... I asked... this... it is, it is
small... they say it is approximately thirty, thirty-five
houses. It is not big.

298
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:57,000
Û miletê xwe jî tune ye. Nîvê heye, nîvê tune ye.
 
And its people are not there. Half are there, half are not.

299
00:15:57,000 --> 00:16:00,000
Dikan di vê gundî da tune ne...
 
There are no shops in this village...

300
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:20,000
Baran... awe... gundî hisên tiştî xwa tînin.
 
Rain... water... the villagers bring their own things.

301
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:38,000
Erê hevalno, gundek Delo, me go sî, sîûpênc mal e, û rêka wî
jî pir çetin e.
 
Yes friends, Delo village, we said it is thirty, thirty-five
houses, and its road is very difficult.

302
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:45,000
Dikan di vê gundî da tune ne. Weke xanûnan dîtin, hewşê
kevnar têda hene...
 
There are no shops in this village. As you saw the houses,
there are ancient yards in it...

303
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:51,000
Binê... ge axê... hîn xanî axê ne... Xwedê seha de wan be.
 
Look... it is earth... there are still earthen houses... May
God help them.

304
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:55,000
Dikan tune, tişt tune, çû d'eyişin.
 
No shops, no things, how do they live?

305
00:16:55,000 --> 00:17:00,000
Bizu... hûrê makîna di şorê ra derê...
 
Quickly... the sound of the car goes into the speech...

306
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:02,000
Erê havo... gundê Delo.
 
Yes friends... Delo village.

307
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:05,000
Ma gundê Delo ne dîbî, ma Delo jî dî.
 
If you haven't seen Delo village, well now you've seen Delo.

308
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:07,000
Ma Rûto jî dî.
 
You saw Rûto too.

309
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:27,000
Bes gundê wan ê çûçik dinav çêda xweş ne.
 
But their small villages are nice inside the mountains.

310
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:55,000
Gelê, çiqas hewşê xwa kevnar ne... tûûû...
 
Folks, how ancient their yards are... wow...

311
00:17:55,000 --> 00:18:04,000
Hê, gundekî xirabe jî... gundê xirabe jî, meriv... wane
têda... nızanım...
 
Yes, a ruined village too... a ruined village too, one...
inside it... I don't know...

312
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:20,000
Xwedê sehde wanoke... Wela dilê meriv milet dişewite, qoro.
 
May God help them... By God, one's heart burns for the
people, folks.

313
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:35,000
Wela gundê Delo jî pir xirabe têda hene... xanî... pir
xirabe... ne...
 
By God, in Delo village there are also many ruins...
houses... very ruined... aren't they...

314
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:45,000
Bare vê mentiqê heşînahîya xwa pir bî ho... heşînahîya xwa
pirîm ge dar bîn, ge merx bîn...
 
Look, the greenery of this region was abundant, huh... its
greenery was abundant, like trees, like junipers...

315
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:50,000
ê nema ye, tişt nema ye. Baran jî tune ne.
 
It is gone, nothing is left. There is no rain either.

316
00:18:50,000 --> 00:19:10,000
Da me go îsal-salê baran huna... çîkere, rehmet bibare.
 
Since we said this year there is rain... hopefully, mercy
will fall.

317
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:19,000
Hîn milet nawatî malê xwa, hîn nawatî malê xwa.
 
The people haven't returned to their homes yet, they haven't
returned to their homes yet.

318
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:30,000
Gotina hindik hatina.
 
They said few have come.

319
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:40,000
Ewa fraqê gund jî... tirba çend tirba li vrane... ew jî
Xwedê rehmo xwal giyo ke.
 
This edge of the village too... the graves, a few graves are
here... may God have mercy on all of them too.

320
00:19:40,000 --> 00:20:00,000
Li vro jî mekbeskê çêdikin...
 
Here they are also making a landfill...

321
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:04,000
Erê hevalno, gundê Dalo me sawirand û gundê Rûto me bi ser
hev de xist.
 
Yes friends, we filmed the village of Dalo and we rushed
through the village of Ruto.

322
00:20:04,000 --> 00:20:08,000
Gund hinek piçûçik bûn, me nekarî nikan tê da teswîra rind
çêkira, ne wekî gundê dinan e.
 
The villages were a bit small, we couldn't film well in
there, it's not like other villages.

323
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:13,000
Wa nebû welle. Yanî Dalo malbet tina bîn, hema bêje kêm.
 
It wasn't like that, really. Meaning in Dalo there were no
families, almost very few.

324
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:17,000
Rûto he bî, malbetek he bî, mala Xalê Mihemed, em çûn...
 
In Ruto there was, there was one family, Uncle Muhammad's
house, we went...

325
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:23,000
...ee gund pir xirabe ye. Yanî dilê me re nexweş e, me re
teswîr jî...
 
...uh the village is very ruined. Meaning our hearts are not
happy with it, regarding the filming too...

326
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:27,000
...dikeve hem çikê kevro bigire, kûmê kevir in.
 
...it just captures heaps of stones, piles of stones.

327
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:30,000
Hûnê qusûrê efû kin ji işta, vîdyoya me ma hûr û hûna kir.
 
Forgive the faults for now, our video turned out like this
and that.

328
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:35,000
Teqsîr meqsîrê me hene, şaşbîn maşbînê me hene jî winê
qusûrê efû kin.
 
If we have shortcomings or mistakes, forgive our faults.

329
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:39,000
Çavê giya maç dikim, Xwedê ji we razî be.
 
I kiss everyone's eyes, may God be pleased with you.

330
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:44,000
Erê hevalno, vîdyoya me hûr û hûna bî. Saeta giya xweş,
Xwedê ji Pêxember ji we giya razî be.
 
Yes friends, our video was like this. Have a good time
everyone, may God and the Prophet be pleased with all of
you.

331
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:50,000
Teben gundê Rûto û Dalo me sawirand, winê qusûrê efû kin.
 
Of course, we filmed the villages of Ruto and Dalo, forgive
the shortcomings.

332
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:54,000
Yanî pir xirabe bîn, me nekarî em bîst sê naqla hem tekror
dikin.
 
Meaning they were very ruined, we couldn't... we repeated it
twenty-three times.

333
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:58,000
Bimînin bi dîsa vîdyoyeke xweş kîbar...
 
Stay for another nice, elegant video...

334
00:20:58,000 --> 00:21:02,000
Emê hecer da daxin inşalla, winê bi ecibînin vîdyoya me.
 
We will upload it to Hecer, God willing, you will like our
video.

335
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:06,000
Û hebîb birakê min, silavê min jêr hene, loyê Xalê Mihemed.
 
And my dear brother, my greetings to him, the son of Uncle
Muhammad.

336
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:10,000
Erê, Hemed Mecîd, silavê min jêr hene, heta ciyê gundê lê...
 
Yes, Hemed Majid, my greetings to him, up to where the
village is...

337
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:13,000
...û qîçkê xolû ra, ser serê min, ser çavê min.
 
...and to the cousins, on my head, on my eyes.

338
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:18,000
Xwedê ji we razî be. Bimînin vîdyoyeke din xweş.
 
May God be pleased with you. Stay for another good video.

